{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-158261","model_call":55,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"china's economic rise\" (+ pntr \"permanent normal trade relations\" wto \"world trade organization\") (+ \"united states\" \"u.s.\" trade))"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"china's economic rise\" (+ pntr \"permanent normal trade relations\" wto \"world trade organization\") (+ \"united states\" \"u.s.\" trade))"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_24_919860399#5_1909878396","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1714","rank":1,"snippet":"\"It eventually was subsumed by the WTO, which was formally established in Geneva, Switzerland in 1995. The WTO's authority is broader than GATT, which only pertains to trading goods. The WTO also monitors the exchange of services, as well as intellectual property. Related: ' A serious attack' -- Major US trading partners blast Trump's tariffs What does Trump think about the WTO? The United States was a key architect of the system governed by GATT and the WTO. But Trump has been critical of the institution. \\\"The WTO has been a disaster for this country,\\\" Trump said last week at a listening session with steel and aluminum executives. He went on to say that <cover>China's economic rise coincided with when it joined the WTO. \"It has been great for China and terrible for the United States, </cover>and great for other countries,\" Trump said.\" , \"start_char\": 1794.000000 , \"title\": \"What is the WTO, and how does it work? A World Trade Organization primer\" , \"url\": \"https://money.cnn.com/2018/03/12/news/economy/what-is-the-wto/index.html\" }"},"time":145},"model_calls":55,"document_judgments":35,"relevance_3":6,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
